{
  "name": "DS02 Decision MIA-3",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DS02 Decision MIA-3\nLa app predice un caso y manda la decision por webhook.\nAPTO = solo log + Telegram. INSPECCION = Google Sheets + Telegram. HANGAR = Postgres + Calendar + Gmail + Telegram.\nTelegram es fire-and-forget: sin botones ni respuesta esperada, en paralelo de cada accion.\nEl Switch tiene salida extra FALLBACK para SIN_DECISION / decisions no reconocidas (registro + Telegram).\nHeader Auth obligatorio (X-DS02-Token). Credenciales: revisar en n8n antes de activar. El JSON se exporta con active:false.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "sticky_intro",
      "name": "Nota intro",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ds02/decision",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "headerAuth"
      },
      "id": "webhook_ds02",
      "name": "Webhook ds02/decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "Entrada: la app DS02 hace POST con decision, unidad, ciclo, RUL, L_inf, usadas, porque y fingerprint.",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR_CREDENCIAL",
          "name": "DS02 Webhook Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c_apto",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.decision || $json.decision }}",
                    "rightValue": "APTO",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "APTO"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c_inspeccion",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.decision || $json.decision }}",
                    "rightValue": "INSPECCION",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "INSPECCION"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c_hangar",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.decision || $json.decision }}",
                    "rightValue": "HANGAR",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "HANGAR"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "id": "switch_decision",
      "name": "Switch por decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "Switch: 3 reglas (APTO, INSPECCION, HANGAR) + salida extra fallbackOutput=extra (indice 3) para SIN_DECISION y cualquier decision no reconocida. Cada salida avisa por Telegram en paralelo de su accion (fire-and-forget, sin botones)."
    },
